SUMMARY:Camp BRIGHT
DESCRIPTION:Camp BRIGHT is a free\, one-day camp for children ages 5–12 who have experienced the death of someone important in their lives. Campers will be supported through fun and creative activities to express their feelings and build connections. \nRegister by scanning the QR code below or by calling 919-719-7199 .
URL:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/event/camp-bright/
LOCATION:Bond Park Community Center\, 150 Metro Park Drive\, Cary\, NC\, 27513\, United States
CATEGORIES:Grief Support,Kids Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.transitionslifecare.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/TGC-butterflies-teal.png
